Accounts Payable Clerk (20 to 32 hours) 20262853 
 - SALARY INDICATION In consultation - JOB GROUP Finance - JOB POSTING NUMBER 720262853 - LOCATION Eindhoven ABOUT THIS JOB OPENING 
Job Description 
You're good at distinguishing between main and secondary financial issues and can handle stress well. You're results-oriented, productive, and excel in a high-pressure environment. You enjoy working both independently and as part of a team. Your colleagues describe you as a hard worker who sets priorities well, is helpful, communicates clearly, and adapts quickly. You take the initiative and are passionate about your work. 
Job Requirements: 
· Process purchase invoices and post expenses based on invoices; 
· Process incoming and outgoing payments; 
· Manage suspense accounts and flag any discrepancies; 
· Serve as the point of contact for financial issues raised by various internal 
stakeholders; 
· You ensure the accurate and timely processing and verification of daily 
bank transactions and payment flows. 
· You provide support to the finance department with various tasks; 
· You assist with financial reviews and the collection of necessary documentation 
for reports and audits. 
· Other related tasks. 
Required skills: 
· MBO+ level (accounting) 
· Accurate, analytical, and meticulous in handling processes 
· You have a good command of Dutch and English (both spoken and 
written); 
· You can work both independently and as part of a team; 
· You are honest and reliable; 
· You are available for 20 to 32 hours per week; 
· Strong communication skills and a sense of responsibility; 
· Strong numerical skills and a solution-oriented mindset; 
· You are a team player and take a problem-solving approach; 
· You are comfortable working with ERP systems (preferably Afas);

Truck driver C - Amsterdam 
Date: Aug 25, 2026 
Location: Amsterdam, NL, 1046 BZ 
Company: sligrofoodgroup 
Amsterdam | fixed routes | €3,520 + bonuses 
Are you looking for a truck driver's job where you work during the day, visit unique locations, and earn a good salary? 
Here's what you'll get 
✅ Gross monthly salary up to €3,520 (scale D6), excluding bonuses; 
✅ Overtime and weekend bonuses up to 150% in accordance with the collective labor agreement; 
✅ Workdays between 5:00 a.m. and 4:00 p.m .;; 
✅ Fixed routes in Amsterdam and the surrounding area; 
✅ Driving new electric delivery trucks ; 
✅ Full reimbursement for Code 95 and driver card ; 
✅ 24 vacation days + 3.5 ATV days; 
✅€1,000 in online credit per year for good performance. 
What will you be doing? 
You'll start your day around 5:00 a.m. with a cup of coffee and then head out on your regular route. You'll deliver orders to hospitality customers and other business clients in Amsterdam and the surrounding area. Together with your colleagues, you'll ensure accurate deliveries and bring returns back to the distribution center. Your workday will be over by around 2:00-4:00 p.m. 
You are 
✅ A holder of a Class C driver's license, a valid Code 95, and a driver's card; 
✅ Residing in Amsterdam (area) and possession of own transport is mandatory; 
✅ Customer-friendly and presentable; 
✅ Physically fit and enjoy being active; 
✅ Fluent in Dutch and/or English; 
✅ Experience as a distribution driver is a plus. 
Want to apply? 
Call or text recruiter Bas Stel directly at 06 - 57 49 96 82 or email bstel@sligro.nl . 
We don't support visa and/or relocations from applicants living abroad. 
